  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5301.01 \"Basic rider course (BRC)\" means the basic rider course established by the motorcycle safety foundation (MSF) for beginning riders.\n\nSource. #6144, eff 12-21-95, EXPIRED 12-21-03\n\nNew. #8403, eff 8-2-05; ss by #10589, eff 5-14-14; ss by #14174, eff 1-17-25",
